<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">How to Download Twitter / X Videos</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Twitter, now called X, is a great source for news clips, memes, interviews, and viral moments. If you want to save a video from X to watch offline or keep for reference, you can do it in a few simple steps.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Copy the tweet link</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Open the tweet with the video. Tap the share icon and select <strong>Copy link</strong>. The URL will look like <code>https://x.com/username/status/ID</code> or <code>https://twitter.com/username/status/ID</code>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Paste it into the downloader</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Visit <a href="/" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline"><%= siteTitle %></a>, paste the link, and click <strong>Get Video</strong>. Our tool will analyze the tweet and show the available video formats.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Pick MP4 or GIF</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Most X videos are available as MP4. Some short clips may also be offered as GIFs. Choose the format that fits your needs and click to download.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Respect creator rights</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">X content is protected by copyright. Save videos for personal use only unless you created them or have permission. Do not repost content without credit.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Can I download Twitter Spaces?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Live Spaces and recorded audio are usually not available as video downloads through standard tools.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Why is my X video low quality?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">X sometimes compresses videos. Pick the highest available format in the list.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Can I download on Android?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Yes, use Chrome or any browser on your Android device.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
